      "leadSummary": "Information stored in nucleic acids must be represented at multiple levels: polymer chemistry, sequence, transcriptional units and observable phenotype. The same base pair can be a stable part of a DNA helix and a mutable target of damage, while the same DNA locus may support several RNA products. The organizing questi"
